            "review_text": "GoPlaces54281651092\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nBest brunch place so far in District 7 Phu My Hung\nJul 2023 • Family\nBest place for my family every weekend . Drinks not too sweet, i love the vietnamese fish noodle (bun ca ro dong) , my kids addicted the chicken garlic fried rice and the traditional vietnamese cakes.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 27, 2023",
